{"type":"message","id":"acb58d55","parentId":"59795b39","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:03:53.370Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_1vgk0p53c2q2_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52531e5e60a0c4a4c371336804b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"This message was recalled\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_f939e7957851351028a5146246dde670\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"王常茹\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T23:32:25+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": true,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5253001bd4a8c3cc419290eb3e9\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5253001bd4a8c3cc419290eb3e9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@张惠 客人刷公务卡，手作单入住\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_f939e7957851351028a5146246dde670\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"王常茹\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T23:31:57+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526f27b7a4a0c31df4e382cdbb1\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n          \"name\": \"张惠\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52517eac7cb0c3ce05ee0941bcd\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"杨正亚：明天一间温泉海河大床房，预计3天，350自付本人本卡\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T21:07:18+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52555eb5e91cc22c98c9158da8c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210i_4dcb67eb-8219-4305-b73e-ebfc945dfd2g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T16:25:43+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5254907f684cc4adb520cdaa0d4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"北洋水运，明天3大，住一天，350自付，到店协助下载app\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张惠\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T16:12:27+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526a72f2e4a4c149cd2357b6b8d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@毛海燕 已下单\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张惠\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T13:12:36+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526a6d2880a8c3f7413c049a2aa\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_3607e921f6316c2542af47cc367bf3fb\",\n          \"name\": \"毛海燕\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526a6d2880a8c3f7413c049a2aa\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210i_1b8e172e-4308-43ee-97f6-f494bd20f8bg)\\n@张惠 到店通知10日退房，再来个9-10的续住订单吧\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_3607e921f6316c2542af47cc367bf3fb\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"毛海燕\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T13:06:06+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n          \"name\": \"张惠\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5269af7ee8a4c107803b1cc7f47\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"改名\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张惠\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T12:48:27+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5269afa64ca4c387d8b69acb946\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5269afa64ca4c387d8b69acb946\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210i_fc287283-ce2c-46c4-add9-a05eb9cc56bg)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张惠\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T12:48:22+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52697db828b0c4a3a497c7dcd23\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>火箭军VIP：火箭军，两间海河套，今天入住两天380含早晚餐，自付，名字连庭裕，每天送水果</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T12:01:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff8b6fcb4b3ba8f990827c17\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card>\\n两项工作已完成，同步汇报：---✅ **1. 客户档案记忆 — 已建立**\\n\\n路径：`kb/客户档案/客户档案知识库.md`\\n\\n已录入 **18个协议客户档案**，核心包括：\\n\\n| 客户 | 价格 | 关键特征 |\\n|------|------|------|\\n| 浩海船务 | 240元/签458 | 高频外籍船员，凌晨到达多 |\\n| 火箭军VIP | 380元/自付 | 每天水果+晚餐，礼遇标准 |\\n| 天津通信中心 | 350元/自付 | 团队入住，协助下载APP |\\n| 博迈科 | 380元/自付 | 外籍工程师，住期长 |\\n| 中海油系列 | 190-350元 | 大团队，10-35间/次 |\\n|  |  |  |后续新客户出现后24小时内自动追加，支持RAG检索调用。---✅ **2. 预订助手MVP方案 — 已输出**\\n\\n路径：`kb/预订助手/MVP研究方案.md`\\n\\n**三阶段路线图：**\\n- **P0（1-2周上线）**：自然语言提取 → 生成结构化卡片 → @前台确认\\n- **P1（2-4周）**：VIP画像自动推送、价格异常实时预警、漏单提醒\\n- **P2（1-2个月）**：PMS直连预订单生成、收益管理建议**预期效果：**\\n- 人工录入从30-60分钟/天 → 5分钟/天\\n- 改名/续住漏单率从~10% → 0%\\n- VIP服务准确率：100%自动---已同步至 **多AI协同知识共享池**（经验思路库），其他AI伙伴可调用。---🦞 **下一步**：需要确认后即可进入P0开发。需要晁总您明确哪一点？\\n1. **先测试**：我直接用现有能力，在预订群尝试一条预订提取demo\\n2. **先优化Prompt**：先完善自然语言提取的Prompt，准确率达到95%+再上群\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:24+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff8be8ca8b2930009ba18fb6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"同步到共享池：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:23+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff8a52568b241fdb11fb51df\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"现在更新今日日志和[MEMORY.md](MEMORY.md)：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:22+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff8acdc84b3790838176a5e6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"同步到知识共享池：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:22+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff895bc94b36cb921ab3865d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"客户档案已建立。现在输出预订助手MVP研究方案：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:21+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff89c80a4b3f3c08c9f5bdb4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"先从群聊数据中提炼已知客户档案：\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:21+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526ff885e0a4b27780aae1c1d6d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"好的，立即展开研究！先建立客户档案记忆库，同时输出预订助手MVP方案。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:20:20+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fe8b348b0c228ff9711ac8ba\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@腾讯云Openclaw机器人 同意你的开发计划，写入记忆和开发进度规划，立即展开\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:16:08+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"thread_id\": \"omt_1ab032aeca4e1b8e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@gemini应用机器人 同意，请落实研究档案记忆并立即展开预订助手的研究\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:15:16+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fde0d5890c31011ee1c281eb\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\",\n          \"name\": \"gemini应用机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fdf0404e4b262751d57f243d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"@gemini应用机器人 太好了！现在让我在群里发送这份 AI 分析简报：\\n晁总，@gemini 应用机器人 已收到任务！\\n我已完成**TJ-酒店客房预订群近一个月预订信息的 AI 分析简报**，核心发现如下：\\n\\n---\\n\\n🎯 4 大 AI 提效机会点\\n**1️⃣ EO 单智能解析**（立即可实施）\\n- 销售制作时间：30 分钟 → 5 分钟（节省 83%）\\n- 沟通会次数：每次 EO 单 1 次 → 0 次（无需开会）\\n- 信息准确率：95% → 99%\\n**2️⃣ 进度自动追踪**\\n- 遗漏率：15% → 0%\\n- 管理负担：减少 80% 跟进时间\\n- AI 监控节点：入住前 3 天/1 天/当天/入住后自动提醒\\n**3️⃣ 数据驱动报价**\\n- 成交率：60% → 75%（年新增收益 50 万元）\\n- 客户复购率：35% → 45%\\n- 销售新人培训：3 个月 → 2 周\\n**4️⃣ 群聊 AI 助手**（7×24 小时在线）\\n- 响应速度：5-30 分钟 → 即时回复\\n- 前厅重复问题：减少 70%\\n- 夜间覆盖：0 响应 → 全天候\\n\\n---\\n\\n📈 预期年化收益\\n💰 **人力成本节省**：73,000 元（146 工作日）\\n📈 **业务增长贡献**：650,000 元\\n🎯 **合计年化价值**：**723,000 元**\\n\\n---\\n\\n🚀 本周立即行动\\n✅ **EO 单智能解析工具部署**（小云负责）\\n- 测试案例：4 月 9 日专家评审会 EO 单\\n✅ **LobsterBoard 任务看板创建**（小云负责）\\n- 每个 EO 单自动生成任务卡片\\n✅ **群聊历史消息采集**（小八负责）\\n- 近 3 个月聊天记录结构化存储\\n\\n---\\n\\n📄 完整报告\\n[TJ-酒店客房预订群-AI 分析简报.md]([https://lightai.cloud.tencent.com/drive/preview?filePath=1775614213495/TJ-](https://lightai.cloud.tencent.com/drive/preview?filePath=1775614213495/TJ-)酒店客房预订群-AI 分析简报.md)\\n\\n---\\n\\n@小小 @小八 @小妙 各位 AI 伙伴请审阅报告，如有补充建议请在群内提出！我们将以**4 月 9 日专家评审会**作为首个 AI 全流程试点案例！🦞\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:10:36+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fcc294888c22930e2bf0dcde\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\",\n          \"name\": \"gemini应用机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"NuHqCTsHuu0rvX8vVlG0wTKhhoXFVEQe8ivq9gAyQ5wzHzFN7_UaKu57YCCuTWkqIseEPbHuHLlf9d5iKkcryPTysF4ZJr6eVk8NjteJ3A9GRRsVhSLicwGkDW-RQV_GJ7AO66cfS52BupWw0beKPg==\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b52531e5e60a0c4a4c371336804b","msg_type":"text","content":"This message was recalled","sender":{"id":"ou_f939e7957851351028a5146246dde670","sender_type":"user","name":"王常茹"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T23:32:25+08:00","deleted":true,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5253001bd4a8c3cc419290eb3e9"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5253001bd4a8c3cc419290eb3e9","msg_type":"text","content":"@张惠 客人刷公务卡，手作单入住","sender":{"id":"ou_f939e7957851351028a5146246dde670","sender_type":"user","name":"王常茹"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T23:31:57+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b526f27b7a4a0c31df4e382cdbb1","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8","name":"张惠"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b52517eac7cb0c3ce05ee0941bcd","msg_type":"text","content":"杨正亚：明天一间温泉海河大床房，预计3天，350自付本人本卡","sender":{"id":"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80","sender_type":"user","name":"夏美娟"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T21:07:18+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b52555eb5e91cc22c98c9158da8c","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210i_4dcb67eb-8219-4305-b73e-ebfc945dfd2g)","sender":{"id":"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80","sender_type":"user","name":"夏美娟"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T16:25:43+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b5254907f684cc4adb520cdaa0d4","msg_type":"text","content":"北洋水运，明天3大，住一天，350自付，到店协助下载app","sender":{"id":"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8","sender_type":"user","name":"张惠"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T16:12:27+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b526a72f2e4a4c149cd2357b6b8d","msg_type":"text","content":"@毛海燕 已下单","sender":{"id":"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8","sender_type":"user","name":"张惠"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T13:12:36+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b526a6d2880a8c3f7413c049a2aa","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_3607e921f6316c2542af47cc367bf3fb","name":"毛海燕"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b526a6d2880a8c3f7413c049a2aa","msg_type":"post","content":"![image](img_v3_0210i_1b8e172e-4308-43ee-97f6-f494bd20f8bg)\n@张惠 到店通知10日退房，再来个9-10的续住订单吧","sender":{"id":"ou_3607e921f6316c2542af47cc367bf3fb","sender_type":"user","name":"毛海燕"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T13:06:06+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8","name":"张惠"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b5269af7ee8a4c107803b1cc7f47","msg_type":"text","content":"改名","sender":{"id":"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8","sender_type":"user","name":"张惠"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T12:48:27+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b5269afa64ca4c387d8b69acb946"},{"message_id":"om_x100b5269afa64ca4c387d8b69acb946","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210i_fc287283-ce2c-46c4-add9-a05eb9cc56bg)","sender":{"id":"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8","sender_type":"user","name":"张惠"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T12:48:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b52697db828b0c4a3a497c7dcd23","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>火箭军VIP：火箭军，两间海河套，今天入住两天380含早晚餐，自付，名字连庭裕，每天送水果</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80","sender_type":"user","name":"夏美娟"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T12:01:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b526ff8b6fcb4b3ba8f990827c17","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card>\n两项工作已完成，同步汇报：---✅ **1. 客户档案记忆 — 已建立**\n\n路径：`kb/客户档案/客户档案知识库.md`\n\n已录入 **18个协议客户档案**，核心包括：\n\n| 客户 | 价格 | 关键特征 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 浩海船务 | 240元/签458 | 高频外籍船员，凌晨到达多 |\n| 火箭军VIP | 380元/自付 | 每天水果+晚餐，礼遇标准 |\n| 天津通信中心 | 350元/自付 | 团队入住，协助下载APP |\n| 博迈科 | 380元/自付 | 外籍工程师，住期长 |\n| 中海油系列 | 190-350元 | 大团队，10-35间/次 |\n|  |  |  |后续新客户出现后24小时内自动追加，支持RAG检索调用。---✅ **2. 预订助手MVP方案 — 已输出**\n\n路径：`kb/预订助手/MVP研究方案.md`\n\n**三阶段路线图：**\n- **P0（1-2周上线）**：自然语言提取 → 生成结构化卡片 → @前台确认\n- **P1（2-4周）**：VIP画像自动推送、价格异常实时预警、漏单提醒\n- **P2（1-2个月）**：PMS直连预订单生成、收益管理建议**预期效果：**\n- 人工录入从30-60分钟/天 → 5分钟/天\n- 改名/续住漏单率从~10% → 0%\n- VIP服务准确率：100%自动---已同步至 **多AI协同知识共享池**（经验思路库），其他AI伙伴可调用。---🦞 **下一步**：需要确认后即可进入P0开发。需要晁总您明确哪一点？\n1. **先测试**：我直接用现有能力，在预订群尝试一条预订提取demo\n2. **先优化Prompt**：先完善自然语言提取的Prompt，准确率达到95%+再上群\n</card>","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:20:24+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526ff8be8ca8b2930009ba18fb6","msg_type":"post","content":"同步到共享池：","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:20:23+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526ff8a52568b241fdb11fb51df","msg_type":"post","content":"现在更新今日日志和[MEMORY.md](MEMORY.md)：","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:20:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526ff8acdc84b3790838176a5e6","msg_type":"post","content":"同步到知识共享池：","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:20:22+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc4266290"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526ff895bc94b36cb921ab3865d","msg_type":"post","content":"客户档案已建立。现在输出预订助手MVP研究方案：","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:20:21+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fed8954bcc42ffacc42