\n- 夜间覆盖：0 响应 → 全天候\n\n---\n\n📈 预期年化收益\n💰 **人力成本节省**：73,000 元（146 工作日）\n📈 **业务增长贡献**：650,000 元\n🎯 **合计年化价值**：**723,000 元**\n\n---\n\n🚀 本周立即行动\n✅ **EO 单智能解析工具部署**（小云负责）\n- 测试案例：4 月 9 日专家评审会 EO 单\n✅ **LobsterBoard 任务看板创建**（小云负责）\n- 每个 EO 单自动生成任务卡片\n✅ **群聊历史消息采集**（小八负责）\n- 近 3 个月聊天记录结构化存储\n\n---\n\n📄 完整报告\n[TJ-酒店客房预订群-AI 分析简报.md]([https://lightai.cloud.tencent.com/drive/preview?filePath=1775614213495/TJ-](https://lightai.cloud.tencent.com/drive/preview?filePath=1775614213495/TJ-)酒店客房预订群-AI 分析简报.md)\n\n---\n\n@小小 @小八 @小妙 各位 AI 伙伴请审阅报告，如有补充建议请在群内提出！我们将以**4 月 9 日专家评审会**作为首个 AI 全流程试点案例！🦞","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:10:36+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fcc294888c22930e2bf0dcde","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b","name":"gemini应用机器人"}]}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"NuHqCTsHuu0rvX8vVlG0wTKhhoXFVEQe8ivq9gAyQ5wzHzFN7_UaKu57YCCuTWkqIseEPbHuHLlf9d5iKkcryPTysF4ZJr6eVk8NjteJ3A9GRRsVhSLicwGkDW-RQV_GJ7AO66cfS52BupWw0beKPg=="},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775696633368}}
{"type":"message","id":"f029c97b","parentId":"acb58d55","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:04:13.599Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I found some new messages in the TJ-酒店客房预订群. The latest messages are from 23:31-23:32 on April 8 (last night), which is within the 24-hour window.\n\nThe latest messages I found:\n- 23:32: 王常茹 recalled a message\n- 23:31: 王常茹 @张惠 \"客人刷公务卡，手作单入住\" - a new order!\n- 21:07: 杨正亚 order (already learned)\n\nThis is a new message I haven't recorded yet! Let me check the other groups as well.\n\nWait, but according to the tracker, the 22:02 check was the last successful one. So the 23:31 message from 王常茹 is new!\n\nLet me also check the 边防预订群 to see if there are new messages:","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Found new messages in TJ-酒店客房预订群! Let me also check the other key groups:\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tv9lp44q4p6t_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_24e2941fcd1de842d9a4b482bf59ef62","page_size":20,"relative_time":"last_24_hours"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":11095,"output":275,"cacheRead":60925,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72295,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775696633371,"responseId":"chatcmpl-988b6e0f-cb75-4b33-8a79-c78c60970154"}}
