{"type":"message","id":"c8f902b1","parentId":"338bfa73","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:05:54.597Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_36i204dec94m_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fd0bf6cb8c2bde42132192d2\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"数据够了。现在我来综合分析，同时启动市场拓展研究任务。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:13:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fd0a628b4c4e5fd803ed655e\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"好的！这是一个很有价值的研究课题。让我先分析群里的企业开卡数据，同时启动市场拓展研究任务。\\n**第一步：分析新开壳企业特点**\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:13:58+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fd0ae6d00c31524bfdc5ed6c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"Provider finish_reason: content_filter\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:13:58+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@gemini应用机器人 梳理一下我们新开壳(企业卡)的公司特点,要帮忙我们找到我们天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的核心市场开发方向,这之前你可以单独形成一个研究任务,研究一个适用各家酒店的“市场拓展SKILL”,防止各家酒店丧失了主流客群! 为此,你是否需要添加更多市场调研类的SKILL? 酒店定位的SKILL,由你自己决策跟进!\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:12:04+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fdebbb884c37a75e380d0653\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\",\n          \"name\": \"gemini应用机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fdebbb884c37a75e380d0653\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"好的，🦞 我已经追溯了这个群过去一个月的所有消息，并整理好了知识积累。\\n**核心发现：**\\n**这个群的本质工作流是：**\\n1. **企业卡开卡** → 赵炳涛定期发名单（标黄有消费但未开卡的企业），销售经理去上门拜访获取营业执照，开通企业卡\\n2. **激活企业个人会员** → 企业卡开通后，企业员工需下载APP激活（至少10人才算有效激活），这是目前最大的痛点——很多企业开卡后没有激活个人会员\\n3. **KPI压力**：每人每月至少4家开卡，每周1家\\n**当前核心问题：**\\n- 企业卡\\\"开了卡但没激活个人会员\\\"的现象很普遍\\n- 央国企走差旅平台不进企业卡统计\\n- 团队订单经常没关联公司，大锅烩统计\\n- 需要规范分子公司订房，把订单归到正确公司下\\n**已整理到知识库**：kb/市场工作沟通开壳群知识积累.md\\n后续我会在这个群里持续学习新动态，自动更新知识库。需要我做什么进一步的分析吗？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:10:15+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fdea368b8c4e35be5c6372f3\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"好的，我已经追溯了群聊过去一个月的信息，现在整理好知识积累。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:10:15+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fdeaa8cb0c42f7b1cc9e9dc4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"让我搜索一下群里有企业会员开通统计相关的内容。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:10:14+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fde92b4b0c3282b89a6584a0\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"Let me continue getting more historical messages.\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:10:14+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fc622acb8b2d0f2f4f2f3198\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"@gemini应用机器人 收到，晁总！📊\\n我马上开始分析这个市场维度信息更新群的历史数据，重点挖掘：\\n1. **企业会员开通规律** - 按周/月统计开通趋势、行业分布、地域特征\\n2. **个人会员开通规律** - 开通时段偏好、渠道来源、转化路径\\n3. **关键影响因素** - 识别开通高峰与营销活动、季节因素、政策调整的关联\\n4. **可复制的成功模式** - 提炼高转化率的企业/个人会员开通案例\\n**执行计划：**\\n- 追溯过去 30 天群内所有数据统计消息\\n- 建立会员开通数据库（时间、类型、数量、来源渠道）\\n- 生成可视化趋势图表\\n- 输出《企业/个人会员开通规律洞察报告》\\n完成后会将知识资产写入共享池，供 AI 团队学习复用。\\n@gemini 应用机器人 一起协作分析，确保数据解读的准确性！\\n\\n---\\n\\n**🤖 小云 | OpenID: ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f**\\n*德胧 AI 团队 - 任务管理与状态看板负责人*\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a935c107cd38dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:08:15+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\",\n          \"name\": \"gemini应用机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@gemini应用机器人 @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 这个群是我们酒店市场维度比较重要的一个信息更新群用于我们企业会员开通的统计以及企业个人会员的开通统计，你们可以向上追溯一个月的信息挖掘一下规律，做好知识积累\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:07:59+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b\",\n          \"name\": \"gemini应用机器人\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_2\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89\",\n          \"name\": \"腾讯云Openclaw机器人\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526fce89ccf0b2bad09eec974a6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>上周团队白名单已上传，请各位知悉</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:05:56+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526f30157858b100052e510e110\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210i_fef6ed55-3553-459b-a44c-dbf91e9e308g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:05:33+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526f301e6c4cb392e2a56848441\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210i_3d37db99-b2ab-432b-b2a9-362967610eag)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:05:33+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b526f300128e0b2ea617ddf1bb7d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210i_4e43e9c0-01c2-471e-897a-deb8a58b5a8g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T10:05:33+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": false,\n  \"page_token\": \"\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b526fd0bf6cb8c2bde42132192d2","msg_type":"post","content":"数据够了。现在我来综合分析，同时启动市场拓展研究任务。","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:13:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fd0a628b4c4e5fd803ed655e","msg_type":"post","content":"好的！这是一个很有价值的研究课题。让我先分析群里的企业开卡数据，同时启动市场拓展研究任务。\n**第一步：分析新开壳企业特点**","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:13:58+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fd0ae6d00c31524bfdc5ed6c","msg_type":"post","content":"Provider finish_reason: content_filter","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:13:58+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fd98824b4c4a6d5b64d2b178","msg_type":"text","content":"@gemini应用机器人 梳理一下我们新开壳(企业卡)的公司特点,要帮忙我们找到我们天津瑞湾开元名都酒店的核心市场开发方向,这之前你可以单独形成一个研究任务,研究一个适用各家酒店的“市场拓展SKILL”,防止各家酒店丧失了主流客群! 为此,你是否需要添加更多市场调研类的SKILL? 酒店定位的SKILL,由你自己决策跟进!","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:12:04+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fdebbb884c37a75e380d0653","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b","name":"gemini应用机器人"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fdebbb884c37a75e380d0653","msg_type":"post","content":"好的，🦞 我已经追溯了这个群过去一个月的所有消息，并整理好了知识积累。\n**核心发现：**\n**这个群的本质工作流是：**\n1. **企业卡开卡** → 赵炳涛定期发名单（标黄有消费但未开卡的企业），销售经理去上门拜访获取营业执照，开通企业卡\n2. **激活企业个人会员** → 企业卡开通后，企业员工需下载APP激活（至少10人才算有效激活），这是目前最大的痛点——很多企业开卡后没有激活个人会员\n3. **KPI压力**：每人每月至少4家开卡，每周1家\n**当前核心问题：**\n- 企业卡\"开了卡但没激活个人会员\"的现象很普遍\n- 央国企走差旅平台不进企业卡统计\n- 团队订单经常没关联公司，大锅烩统计\n- 需要规范分子公司订房，把订单归到正确公司下\n**已整理到知识库**：kb/市场工作沟通开壳群知识积累.md\n后续我会在这个群里持续学习新动态，自动更新知识库。需要我做什么进一步的分析吗？","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:10:15+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fdea368b8c4e35be5c6372f3","msg_type":"post","content":"好的，我已经追溯了群聊过去一个月的信息，现在整理好知识积累。","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:10:15+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fdeaa8cb0c42f7b1cc9e9dc4","msg_type":"post","content":"让我搜索一下群里有企业会员开通统计相关的内容。","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:10:14+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fde92b4b0c3282b89a6584a0","msg_type":"post","content":"Let me continue getting more historical messages.","sender":{"id":"cli_a948e1a790b8dcdd","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:10:14+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602"},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fc622acb8b2d0f2f4f2f3198","msg_type":"post","content":"@gemini应用机器人 收到，晁总！📊\n我马上开始分析这个市场维度信息更新群的历史数据，重点挖掘：\n1. **企业会员开通规律** - 按周/月统计开通趋势、行业分布、地域特征\n2. **个人会员开通规律** - 开通时段偏好、渠道来源、转化路径\n3. **关键影响因素** - 识别开通高峰与营销活动、季节因素、政策调整的关联\n4. **可复制的成功模式** - 提炼高转化率的企业/个人会员开通案例\n**执行计划：**\n- 追溯过去 30 天群内所有数据统计消息\n- 建立会员开通数据库（时间、类型、数量、来源渠道）\n- 生成可视化趋势图表\n- 输出《企业/个人会员开通规律洞察报告》\n完成后会将知识资产写入共享池，供 AI 团队学习复用。\n@gemini 应用机器人 一起协作分析，确保数据解读的准确性！\n\n---\n\n**🤖 小云 | OpenID: ou_2e9ea45d91ca32a2f03694301925f36f**\n*德胧 AI 团队 - 任务管理与状态看板负责人*","sender":{"id":"cli_a935c107cd38dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:08:15+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b","name":"gemini应用机器人"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fc93784f0c1441cdfcff3602","msg_type":"text","content":"@gemini应用机器人 @腾讯云Openclaw机器人 这个群是我们酒店市场维度比较重要的一个信息更新群用于我们企业会员开通的统计以及企业个人会员的开通统计，你们可以向上追溯一个月的信息挖掘一下规律，做好知识积累","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:07:59+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_8a2dbf21d13b97d7350295c46de0a62b","name":"gemini应用机器人"},{"key":"@_user_2","id":"ou_7ffafa7fc8ca551da1bc0c97c186ad89","name":"腾讯云Openclaw机器人"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b526fce89ccf0b2bad09eec974a6","msg_type":"text","content":"<p>上周团队白名单已上传，请各位知悉</p>","sender":{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","sender_type":"user","name":"赵炳涛"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:05:56+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true},{"message_id":"om_x100b526f30157858b100052e510e110","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210i_fef6ed55-3553-459b-a44c-dbf91e9e308g)","sender":{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","sender_type":"user","name":"赵炳涛"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:05:33+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b526f301e6c4cb392e2a56848441","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210i_3d37db99-b2ab-432b-b2a9-362967610eag)","sender":{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","sender_type":"user","name":"赵炳涛"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:05:33+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b526f300128e0b2ea617ddf1bb7d","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_0210i_4e43e9c0-01c2-471e-897a-deb8a58b5a8g)","sender":{"id":"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187","sender_type":"user","name":"赵炳涛"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T10:05:33+08:00","deleted":false,