{"type":"message","id":"5589b957","parentId":"4541765a","timestamp":"2026-04-09T01:06:54.462Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ai5lr2pw688x_1","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b525af47840a8b29063f10463439\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210j_ee9cf248-7bae-45b1-8c5d-e1ce2744ed3g)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-09T07:58:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b525af98be0acb34606f4e5f61fe\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210j_8918ed99-efc2-4f78-ac03-4aa09b26aa9g)\\n1706档案显示实名会员,APP绑定如上，0104显示未下载，特此报备\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-09T07:57:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520eabe410a0c117db31c9785df\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_0210g_abfce9a5-032a-4bd9-9b85-11316113e83g)\\n![image](img_v3_0210g_4151f190-cdc7-49b8-8a72-f681e72e1dag)\\n关于这个工单我在知识库补充了一个一次性马桶垫的问答\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_df304985e8d294fb8052e01ffb8d5501\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张婉婷\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T21:00:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52025b8d186cc44b284357e6275\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"好的，那麻烦MOD电话以后注意保持电话畅通\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:31:32+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52025caeeca4c2e1f80ad69ac86\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@林广辉 第一个电话正在维修，第二个电话可以接通\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"田静\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:30:46+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b5201abcf80a0c146c61f687c99e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n          \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201ab6804a4c2eaed54068f839\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"我核实下\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_030cf497a5d422b7f507c422bb9aca65\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"田静\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:18:50+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201abcf80a0c146c61f687c99e\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"这个电话我联系很多天都打不通了，如果更换了号码，麻烦在系统上更改一下，谢谢\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:18:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5201acfab4a0c34770ec0ef9dca\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"你们现在MOD还是这个电话么\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15