\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_e650c72bb2704ab224a1c2977188866b\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"林广辉\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-06T15:11:57+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b521602dc18a8c42453b80529702\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"紧急/投诉工单台账填写提醒\\\">\\n目前有紧急|投诉工单尚未填写处理结果，辛苦酒店各负责人尽快填写，谢谢！\\n\\n\\n[台账填写](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Etl0bbQ0XahkaTsaP3gcZsvmnZg?from=from_copylink&ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_button)\\n---\\n来自 [虫洞工单台账](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Etl0bbQ0XahkaTsaP3gcZsvmnZg?ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_link)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a903c4bc0f389bc9\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T17:00:49+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52167e84e4a4c2a656705fb1958\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"紧急/投诉工单台账填写通知\\\">\\n任务：紧急/投诉工单处理结果填写\\n时限：当天17：30前\\n要求：详细填写处理的过程和结果，不能只填“已处理“”已完成“”已联系“等情况不明的描述。\\n今天需填写的工单已更新，辛苦酒店各负责人点击下方[台账填写]按钮，根据实际情况详细填写[处理结果]，谢谢！\\n[台账填写](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/Etl0bbQ0XahkaTsaP3gcZsvmnZg?from=from_copylink&ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_button)\\n---\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a903c4bc0f389bc9\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-05T16:53:24+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53d0710460bcb4b86b43a30de39\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"Ai PMS功能更新通知-2026/04/02\\\">\\n更新信息如下：\\n1、最后更新日期：2026-04-02\\n2、最后更新人：韩恩恩\\n3、最后更新内容：更新章节：第四章：Ai PMS系统其他能力。内容：PAD 端 Ai PMS 选房页面重磅升级，房间号选择全面AI化，根据用户喜好，由神灯决策最佳房间号\\n\\n详细内容请前往操作手册查看：\\n[https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/MWuAwgQYHiOfdtk9Y3WcZNWcn2g](https://delonix.feishu.cn/wiki/MWuAwgQYHiOfdtk9Y3WcZNWcn2g)\\n~~~~~~~~~\\n本消息由AI自动生成，如有疑问联系【韩恩恩】\\n---\\n来自 [德胧生态小助手（通知）](https://delonix.feishu.cn/base/HiaUbqSsLav0BnsQWEactEennxb?ccm_open_type=im_card_workflow_link)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_b6c4c2b5f63d677c8927c51b263d0f44\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"韩恩恩\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-02T18:25:00+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538dbc5c60a8b4b2bdfa621dd09\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"嗯嗯。刚刚应该还是未入住的那个团队订单的提示。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_c536828caccac6955566810eaf0fec82\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阳鹏\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:17:13+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538da1b4b488b3dd0347d8e766d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"刚重新试验，发现可以了，谢谢\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:16:23+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538d8f51f8a0c29d4b0226f9f1a\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@刘东东 哪个不可以。。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_c536828caccac6955566810eaf0fec82\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"阳鹏\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-03-31T18:04:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b538de4fa6d6cb494c5e8611d29c\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_1ea58f21699b6576cd93c65ffbc1c22a\",\n          \"name\": \"刘东东\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"messag